27: Class `Nette\Application\IRouter` is replaced by `Nette\Routing\Router`.
29: Static property `Nette\Application\Routers\Route::$defaultFlags` is removed: the router keeps the protocol of the request; write `https://` into the mask of a route that has to be secured, since nette/application 3.0.
29: Constant `Nette\Application\Routers\Route::SECURED` is removed: write the protocol, `https://`, into the mask of the route, since nette/application 3.0.
30: Static property `Nette\Application\Routers\Route::$styles` is removed: set the pattern and the filters of a parameter in the metadata of each route, under the name of the parameter, since nette/application 3.0.
30: Constant `Nette\Routing\Route::PATTERN` is replaced by `Route::Pattern`.
33: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::offsetSet()` is replaced by `add($router)`.
33: Constant `Nette\Application\Routers\Route::MODULE_KEY` is removed: write the key `'module'` as a string, since nette/application 3.0.
33: Constant `Nette\Application\Routers\Route::PRESENTER_KEY` is removed: write the key `'presenter'` as a string, since nette/application 3.0.
34: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::offsetSet()` is replaced by `add($router)`.
34: Constructor `Nette\Application\Routers\Route::__construct()` is deprecated: pass the flag as the third argument of `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::addRoute()`, which creates the route, since nette/application 3.1.
34: Constant `Nette\Routing\Router::ONE_WAY` is deprecated: pass `oneWay: 1` to `Nette\Routing\RouteList::add()`, `Nette\Routing\RouteList::addRoute()` or `Nette\Routing\RouteList::prepend()`, since nette/routing 3.1.4.
35: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::offsetSet()` is replaced by `add($router)`.
35: Constructor `Nette\Application\Routers\SimpleRouter::__construct()` is deprecated: pass the flag as the second argument of `Nette\Routing\RouteList::add()` when adding the router, since nette/application 3.1.
35: Constant `Nette\Application\Routers\SimpleRouter::PRESENTER_KEY` is removed: write the key `'presenter'` as a string, since nette/application 3.0.
35: Constant `Nette\Application\IRouter::SECURED` is removed: write the protocol, `https://`, into the mask of the route, since nette/application 3.0.
36: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::offsetSet()` is deprecated: there is no replacement; no public method replaces the router at an index; add the routers in the order they are to be matched, since nette/application 3.3.
36: Constant `Nette\Application\Routers\CliRouter::PRESENTER_KEY` is removed: write the key `'presenter'` as a string, since nette/application 3.0.
37: Constructor `Nette\Application\Routers\SimpleRouter::__construct()` is deprecated: call `withModule()` of `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList` and add the router to the list it returns, since nette/application 3.0.
38: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::offsetUnset()` is deprecated: there is no replacement; no public method removes the router at an index; leave the router out when the list is built, since nette/application 3.3.
40: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::offsetExists()` is replaced by `isset(getRouters()[$index])`.
40: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::count()` is replaced by `\count(getRouters())`.
41: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::offsetGet()` is replaced by `getRouters()[$index]`.
44: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\RouteList::getIterator()` is removed: iterate over `getRouters()`, which returns an array of the routers, since nette/application 3.1.
53: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\Route::getFlags()` is removed: the one-way flag is kept by the route list, whose `getFlags()` returns it for each router, since nette/application 3.1.
53: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\SimpleRouter::getFlags()` is removed: the one-way flag is kept by the route list, whose `getFlags()` returns it for each router, since nette/application 3.1.
53: Method `Nette\Application\Routers\Route::getTargetPresenters()` is removed: there is no replacement; a route no longer says which presenters it leads to, since nette/application 3.0.
60: Static method `Nette\Application\UI\Component::getPersistentParams()` is removed: mark public properties with `#[Nette\Application\Attributes\Persistent]`; the parameters are found by reflection and the method is no longer called, since nette/application 3.0.
66: Class `Nette\Application\UI\PresenterComponent` is replaced by `Nette\Application\UI\Component`.
