80: Annotation `@persistent` is replaced by the attribute `#[Nette\Application\Attributes\Persistent]`, but the text after it has no place there.
83: Property `Nette\Application\UI\Presenter::$allowedMethods` is deprecated: use `#[Nette\Application\Attributes\Requires(methods: [...])]` on the presenter class or on the action, since nette/application 3.2.3.
89: Method `Nette\Application\UI\Presenter::getContext()` is removed: inject the services the presenter needs; the DI container is no longer passed to it, since nette/application 3.1.
