118: Method `Nette\Application\UI\Component::redirect()` is replaced by `redirectPermanent(...)`.
123: Attribute `#[Nette\Application\Attributes\CrossOrigin]` is replaced by `#[Nette\Application\Attributes\Requires(sameOrigin: false)]`.
127: Method `Nette\Application\UI\Component::redirect()` is deprecated: call `redirectPermanent()` for 301, or `redirectUrl()` of the presenter with the URL of `link()` and the code, since nette/application 3.0.
