134: Method `Nette\Application\UI\Presenter::createRequest()` is deprecated: links are built by `Nette\Application\LinkGenerator`, so an override no longer changes them; call `link()` or `createRequest()` of `getLinkGenerator()`, since nette/application 3.2.3.
136: Method `Nette\Application\UI\Presenter::createRequest()` is deprecated: links are built by `Nette\Application\LinkGenerator`, so an override no longer changes them; call `link()` or `createRequest()` of `getLinkGenerator()`, since nette/application 3.2.3.
140: Method `Nette\Application\UI\Presenter::checkHttpMethod()` is deprecated: use `#[Nette\Application\Attributes\Requires(methods: [...])]` on the presenter class or on the action, since nette/application 3.2.3.
142: Property `Nette\Application\UI\Presenter::$allowedMethods` is deprecated: use `#[Nette\Application\Attributes\Requires(methods: [...])]` on the presenter class or on the action, since nette/application 3.2.3.
143: Method `Nette\Application\UI\Presenter::checkHttpMethod()` is deprecated: use `#[Nette\Application\Attributes\Requires(methods: [...])]` on the presenter class or on the action, since nette/application 3.2.3.
149: Method `Nette\Application\UI\Presenter::requestToUrl()` is deprecated: call `requestToUrl()` of `getLinkGenerator()`, passing `!$this->absoluteUrls` as the second argument where the call left it out, since nette/application 3.2.3.
