213: Property `Nette\Application\Application::$catchExceptions` is deprecated: exceptions are caught whenever `$errorPresenter` is set; leave it `null` to let them through, since nette/application 3.2.1.
214: Method `Nette\Application\Application::processException()` is removed: call `createErrorRequest()`, which returns the request of the error presenter or `null`, and pass that request to `processRequest()`, since nette/application 3.2.1.
215: Method `Nette\Application\LinkGenerator::link()` is replaced by `link(destination: $destination, args: $args)`.
